292
00:10:34,196 --> 00:10:35,218
with interest,

293
00:10:35,218 --> 00:10:36,652
for decades.

294
00:10:36,917 --> 00:10:39,667
Let me put the whole bill together.

295
00:10:39,767 --> 00:10:41,527
Old wires to replace,

296
00:10:41,527 --> 00:10:43,657
and new ones to build.

297
00:10:43,727 --> 00:10:46,267
Fuel that swings up and down.

298
00:10:46,277 --> 00:10:48,889
Data centers bidding for the same power

299
00:10:48,889 --> 00:10:49,697
plants.

300
00:10:49,697 --> 00:10:52,254
And a business model that rewards building

301
00:10:52,254 --> 00:10:53,067
more.

302
00:10:53,367 --> 00:10:55,427
Each one is a reason.

303
00:10:55,457 --> 00:10:56,529
Together,

304
00:10:56,529 --> 00:10:59,603
they explain why the bill keeps climbing.

305
00:10:59,850 --> 00:11:03,013
So why are America's electricity bills

306
00:11:03,013 --> 00:11:04,100
rising?

307
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:06,185
Not because electricity got harder to

308
00:11:06,185 --> 00:11:06,950
make.

309
00:11:07,240 --> 00:11:09,496
Because the system that delivers it is

310
00:11:09,496 --> 00:11:10,296
being rebuilt,

311
00:11:10,296 --> 00:11:12,122
the fuel became volatile,

312
00:11:12,122 --> 00:11:14,584
and a new generation of machines is

313
00:11:14,584 --> 00:11:16,430
competing with your home for the same

314
00:11:16,430 --> 00:11:17,440
power.

315
00:11:17,540 --> 00:11:19,127
The light switch looks the same as

316
00:11:19,127 --> 00:11:20,180
ever.

317
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:23,255
The economics behind it have changed.

318
00:11:23,517 --> 00:11:25,933
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

319
00:11:25,933 --> 00:11:28,814
we follow the money behind another hidden

320
00:11:28,814 --> 00:11:31,187
link of the world economy.

321
00:11:31,307 --> 00:11:33,521
This is The Hidden Economics.
